# Who must review what.
#
# The design pack calls for two reviewer accounts: an engineering-lead account that owns the simulation and
# the renderer foundation, and a design-lead account that owns the design documents
# (AGENT-ROLES-AND-WORKFLOW §4, KS-01-06). Neither account exists on this repository yet — `@aliceagent` is
# its only collaborator — so every path below routes to `@aliceagent` today. When the two reviewer accounts
# are created, split the ownership at the marked lines; nothing else about this file has to change.
#
# See the branch-protection checklist on the Sprint 01 tracking issue: CODEOWNERS only has teeth once
# "Require review from Code Owners" is switched on.

# Everything, unless a more specific rule below wins.
*                           @aliceagent

# --- engineering lead ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pure simulation and the pieces of the renderer everything else is built on. A mistake here is a mistake in
# every sprint that follows.
/src/core/**                @aliceagent
/src/game/**                @aliceagent
/src/render/renderer.js     @aliceagent
/src/render/camera.js       @aliceagent

# --- design lead --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The numbers, the rules and the reference images. Changing these changes the game, not the code.
/docs/design/**             @aliceagent
